<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P says rates Oesterreichische Kontrollbank AAA.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says rates Oesterreichische Kontrollbank AAA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned its AAA rating to Oesterreichische Kontrollbank A.G.'s 30 billion yen worth of yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds.</p>
<p>The bonds mature on September 28, 1998.</p>
</text>
